  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://w3id.org/ad4gd/ev/ebv/SP_abn_TER_bird_MRA">
    <skos:definition>The (relative) abundance of European rare, priority, and common bird species within contiguous spatial units (grid cells) across the EU over time. Modeled relative abundance of breeding wintering and passage individuals.</skos:definition>
